  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Ice poison starfish’s poison can be removed with underworld yellow water. It is a rank eight immortal material, very rare even in Eastern Sea. Immortal materials at rank eight are usually exclusively traded with each other, so exchanging other goods for this water is often refused.",
      "chapters": [
        1648
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "antidote-and-corrosion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "sys_immortal_material"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Used in the right amount, it cleanses a Gu Immortal’s body and fully neutralizes the ice poison starfish’s poison. The water is also corrosive on an undefended Gu Immortal body, so the dose must be careful.",
      "chapters": [
        1648
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "antidote-and-corrosion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Heavenly Court and Southern Border buy out time path immortal materials, those materials rise sharply in price. Offering the extreme time pole draws Heavenly Court’s notice and can secure a huge amount of underworld yellow water in trade.",
      "chapters": [
        1648
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "treasure-yellow-heaven-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Miao Ming Shen again uses the extreme time pole in treasure yellow heaven to exchange for underworld yellow water and cleanses Gui Qi Ye of ice poison starfish poison. He obtains the water much earlier than in the previous life, then uses just the right amount because the water is corrosive on an undefended Gu Immortal body.",
      "chapters": [
        1887
      ],
